                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Average game at best.\n\n+The graphics are good for the era\n+The Combat is fun\n+Works well on modern Windows 11 PC\n+Some good perks to call in\n\n- The weapons are very limited\n- The biomes are just variations of colour \n- There is no story at all\n- There is no reason to level up and gain experience \n\n\nOverall it's a fun little cheap game; getting through the level sometimes is hard, but there is some strategy involved in route pickups. Having a little look into a base and then coming back when you have that airstrike, etc.\nHowever, all the weapons are just point and shoot and unless I miss something there no reason to level up and keep men alive other than your gravesite gets bigger.\n\nNever played 1 or 2, so can't comment, but it plays out like a cheap iPad game but with a mouse and keyboard.\n\n\n\n\n",
